{"caption":"The video depicts a studio-like interior with grey walls, two metal shelving racks stacked with cardboard boxes, a closed door, and two bright softbox lights flanking a white floor. A central yellow-and-white checkered lane runs toward the viewer, bordered by horizontal green bead boundary lines, while the background stays fixed.

Across this bare lane, a single-file queue of spherical-bead kart figures enters from the left and translates steadily rightward, each occluded by the frame edge as it passes. The maroon-hatted figure on a bead kart slides into view first, crosses the checkered lane, and drifts off the right edge. Behind it follows a green-hatted figure on a similar kart, then a green-and-white dinosaur-like rider, then a blue spiky figure, all keeping roughly constant left-to-right spacing. The four riders form a continuous procession moving in the same direction, the lane and lines staying stationary beneath them.

As the last blue spiky kart clears the right edge, the checkered lane returns to being empty. The studio backdrop remains entirely fixed throughout. The observed motion is purely object translation.","length_note":""}
